invariant: INV-62
file: src/mldsa_sign_steps.c
catches: mldsa_signer_test_host
reason: a host object's mlds_expand decodes s2 without its range check,
  so a key whose s2 holds a value outside [-2, 2] signs, where the device
  frame refuses it. bin/mldsa_signer_test_host signs under such a key on
  both frames and requires a refusal from each.

--- old
        ok &= mlds_unpack_eta(&ex->key.s2_hat[i], sk + MLDS_SK_S2_AT + (size_t)i * MLDS_ETA_BYTES);
--- new
        (void)mlds_unpack_eta(&ex->key.s2_hat[i], sk + MLDS_SK_S2_AT + (size_t)i * MLDS_ETA_BYTES);
